@startuml Sequence Diagram - Registro de Paciente
actor Paciente
participant ClientsService
participant AuthService
participant ClientsDB

Paciente -> ClientsService: POST /register (dados)
ClientsService -> AuthService: POST /generate-token (dados)
AuthService -> AuthService: Valida e gera JWT
AuthService --> ClientsService: Retorna token
ClientsService -> ClientsDB: Salva User/Patient
ClientsService --> Paciente: Retorna sucesso + token
@enduml
